{
  "id": "poem-070",
  "body": "<div class=\"poem-text\"><p class=\"poem-stanza\" id=\"verse-1\"><span class=\"poem-line\">慈悲智慧共呼应，心境安然似水清。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">合一天地生灵意，放松身心任风行。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">遥望苍茫宇宙间，微笑，因果法则自然成。</span><span class=\"poem-line\">顺遂人生踏浮华，回首，已无往事也无惊。</span></p></div><figure class=\"poem-illustration\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"poem-art-open\" data-poem-art=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/070.webp\" data-caption=\"《融》\" aria-label=\"放大欣赏插画《融》\"><img src=\"/books/jing-mi-de-kuang-chao/art/070.webp\" width=\"885\" height=\"1050\" alt=\"亮子绘制的原书插画《融》\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></button><figcaption>《融》 · 亮子<span>轻触画面，放大欣赏</span></figcaption></figure><p class=\"poem-original-page\">原书第 70 页</p>"
}
